# Derived checks (MPFR 4.2.2 expected values).
# Exact hypot ties: a = t(t+1) 2^e, b = (2t+1)/2 2^e give a^2 + b^2 = (a + 2^(e-1))^2,
# the midpoint above a; nearest-even keeps a.
check hypot(4503599694479360.0, 67108864.5) == 4503599694479360.0
check hypot(0.003906250058207661, 5.820766134714828e-11) == 0.003906250058207661
check hypot(4.203046373462439e-286, 6.26302663832303e-294) == 4.203046373462439e-286
check hypot(8.56521747791982e+286, 8.508779044326072e+278) == 8.56521747791982e+286
check cbrt(1.0) == 1.0
check cbrt(8.0) == 2.0
check cbrt(27.0) == 3.0
check cbrt(0.125) == 0.5
check cbrt(5e-324) == 1.7031839360032603e-108
check cbrt(8.98846567431158e+307) == 4.4794894843556084e+102
check cbrt(1.7976931348623157e+308) == 5.643803094122362e+102
check cbrt(6.675221575521604e-308) == 4.0565350118095865e-103
# error-free transformations are exact
check two_sum(1.0, 1e-30)[1] == 1e-30
check two_prod(134217729.0, 134217729.0)[1] == 1.0
check two_prod(0.1, 0.1)[0] + two_prod(0.1, 0.1)[1] == two_prod(0.1, 0.1)[0]
check pow2(-1074) == 5e-324
check pow2(1023) == 8.98846567431158e+307
check cbrt(0.0 - 27.0) == 0.0 - 3.0
check hypot(3.0, 4.0) == 5.0
check sqrt(2.0) == 1.4142135623730951
check exp(0.0) == 1.0
check exp(1.0) == 2.718281828459045
check exp(0.0 - 1.0) == 0.36787944117144233
